namespace":"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":512,"height":512,"uv_width":512,"uv_height":512,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"10076567-4370-5227-8a1c-eef276334fc7","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# farm_field_t1\n\nFarm field tier 1: a stick fence round dug rows. Crops are separate props (G4) placed on the rows (each row 1 column = 16 u wide).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: dark earth furrows with clods and weeds between grass headland strips, bed edging boards and seed-tag stakes, a sturdier fence with stone corner markers, a gate with lantern posts, a cobble path and signpost, a scarecrow with a crow, a tool rack, water barrel and trough, hay bales, sacks and a wheelbarrow. Crops are still drawn by the game on the slot_row lines.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with the same layout and much more detail: dark earth furrows with clods and weeds between grass headland strips, bed edging boards and seed-tag stakes, a sturdier fence with stone corner markers, a gate with lantern posts, a cobble path and signpost, a scarecrow with a crow, a tool rack, water barrel and trough, hay bales, sacks and a wheelbarrow. Crops are still drawn by the game on the slot_row lines.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -64..65, y 0..47, z -67..65 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: finished 509, construction_0 185, construction_33 464, construction_66 487, ruined 622 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `farm_field_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 126 x 44 x 126 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Notes\n\n- Rows run along X, 7 rows of 16 u on 8 x 8 columns; `slot_row_N` marks the centre line of each row (crop props sit there).\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -70)\n- `slot_row_1` at (0, 3, -48)\n- `slot_row_2` at (0, 3, -32)\n- `slot_row_3` at (0, 3, -16)\n- `slot_row_4` at (0, 3, 0)\n- `slot_row_5` at (0, 3, 16)\n- `slot_row_6` at (0, 3, 32)\n- `slot_row_7` at (0, 3, 48)"}